          <span id="alg1.l23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Output</span><span id="alg1.l23.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">: The optimized parameters </span><math id="alg1.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\boldsymbol{\theta}^{*},\boldsymbol{\phi}^{*}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝜽</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϕ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\boldsymbol{\theta}^{*},\boldsymbol{\phi}^{*}\}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l23.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and codebook </span><math id="alg1.l23.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{C}=\{{\mathbf{c}_{i}^{l}}^{*}\,|\,i=1,\ldots,N_{\text{cw}},\ l=1,\ldots,L\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒞</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐜</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></mmultiscripts><mo fence="false" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">cw</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.627em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}=\{{\mathbf{c}_{i}^{l}}^{*}\,|\,i=1,\ldots,N_{\text{cw}},\ l=1,\ldots,L\}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l23.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</div>
